S232 equipment (such as barcode scanners, printers, or industrial machinery) to modern computers, which often lack the necessary ports.</p><p><br></p><p>These converters are typically plug-and-play, meaning no additional drivers or software are needed, making them easy to use. They can support various data transfer speeds, from standard USB 2.0 up to USB 3.0 or higher for faster data transfer. USB converters are compatible with multiple operating systems, including Windows, macOS, and Linux, and are ideal for both professional and personal use when connecting legacy devices to modern systems.</p>","detailsHtml":"<p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;USB Converter, Accessories</span></p>","topDesc":"","subcats":[],"products":[{"id":"252","name":"Dtech DT-6515 HDMI to VGA M-FHD Converter","href":"/accessories/usb-converter/dtech-dt-6515-hdmi-to-vga-m-fhd-converter","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/DTECH/DT-6515/DT-6515-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"imageSecond":null,"price":"450৳","oldPrice":null,"label":null,"requestPrice":false,"brand":{"name":"DTECH","href":"/index.php?route=product/manufacturer/info&manufacturer_id=49"},"model":"DT-6515","features":["Model: DT-6515","Type: HDMI to VGA Converter Cable Adapter","Cable Length: 0.5 Meter","VGA output supports a maximum resolution of 1080P","Material: Pure copper"]},{"id":"253","name":"Orico AH-13-GY-BP Type-C to USB3.0 HUB","href":"/accessories/usb-converter/orico-ah-13-gy-bp-type-c-to-usb30-hub","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/ORICO/12F-GY-BP/ORICO-AH-13-GY-BP-800-3-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"imageSecond":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/ORICO/12F-GY-BP/ORICO-AH-13-GY-BP-800-4-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"price":"480৳","oldPrice":"700৳","label":"-31 %","requestPrice":false,"brand":{"name":"ORICO","href":"/orico"},"model":"Model:AH-13/12F-GY-BP","features":["Model:AH-13/12F-GY-BP","Input: Type-C","Output: USB3.0x1，USB2.0x3","Transmission Sp